					Comment for Type of Reporting Person:
				</div><div class="largetext" style="text-align:justify">Note for Lines (7), (9), and (11) - Consists of 535,902,982 Class A ordinary shares, par value $0.000001 per share, of Grab Holdings Limited.
Note for Line (13) - The percent of class beneficially owned by the Reporting Person was calculated assuming 3,972,725,983 Class A ordinary shares issued and outstanding as of January 31, 2026, as described in the Issuer's report on Form 20-F filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on March 6, 2026. Represents approximately 5.5% of the voting power of the common shares of the Issuer as a result of the 127,755,800 Class B ordinary shares issued and outstanding as of January 31, 2026, as described in the Issuer's report on Form 20-F filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on March 6, 2026.</div></div></div><div class="form1"><table><tr><td class="center"><br><br><p><div align="center" style="font-size:1.2em;">
